name = "Gorbertron"

ds_list_add(textList, "Welcome.", "I see you've made it all the way to my gym. That is very impressive.",
"I’m called Gorbertron.","I am an ÜBER-MORLOCK.","I’m the Gym Leader for Mutant Path.",
"What are these things on your desk?", "Ah, you like the accoutrements on my desk!", 
"Thank you, I pride myself on my decor.", "Well, on your right is a toy model… and then we have my pet, Captain Tribble.",
"What are the Morlocks?","The Morlocks were human once... But the forces of evolution and mutation have changed us. Bettered us.",
"We are no longer slaves to the Sun; we can work much longer hours...", "You think we should mourn our lost humanity? Such arrogance! Why should we? We are so much more.",
"What’s an Uber-Morlock?", "An advanced form of Morlock. Unlike the other Morlocks... I’ve gained certain abilities. I can move objects with my mind!",
"What is this place?", "This entire place is devoted to one goal: human evolution. You see, Morlocks are the better forms of humans, and I'm devoted to mutating humans into greater forms.",
"If we can bring human-types up to their next stage, humans can become the ULTIMATE POKéMON. By experimenting with evolution, we can achieve godlike status",
"and YOU WILL NOT GET IN MY WAY!!.", "That said... Are you ready to challenge me?")

